{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56222","headline":"述怀 · 张蠙","name":"述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白首成空事，无欢可替悲。\n空余酒中兴，犹似少年时。\n（见王安石《唐百宏壮诗选》卷十九。\n李壁《王荆公诗笺注》卷四一引前二句。\n）（按：《万首唐人绝句》卷九三收此诗於崔橹名下，《全唐诗》卷五六七沿之。\n《唐百家诗选》早出，今两存之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}